  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Chop the onion and sauté it in olive oil until softened.",
    "Add the garlic, cumin, turmeric, and paprika, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the dried azifa and cook for 2 minutes, stirring frequently.",
    "Add the chopped kale and cook until wilted.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a baking dish and season with salt and black pepper.",
    "Bake for 20-25 minutes, or until the kale is tender.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!"
